<%# Email Content: the wording of this form's four notification emails
    (Forms::TemplateEmail). No recipients here — email rules above, inbox
    notifications in Settings and form subscriptions in Settings and on the ACL
    page decide who is told; all of them send the text written here.

    Each box shows what is sent today, the default until someone changes it.
    Text still matching the default is saved as "use the default", and an
    emptied box goes back to it.

    Locals:
      form_template  the Forms::Template being edited
      field_names    columns a {{field.*}} placeholder can read
-%>
<div class="form-group notification-emails" style="margin-top: 24px;">
  <label>Email Content</label>
  <small class="form-text notification-emails__help">
    What this form's emails say, whoever receives them. Placeholders are filled in from the
    submission: <code>{{reference}}</code>, <code>{{link}}</code> (a button that opens the
    submission), <code>{{url}}</code>, <code>{{form_name}}</code>, <code>{{submitter_name}}</code>,
    <code>{{submitter_email}}</code>, <code>{{submitted_at}}</code>, <code>{{status_label}}</code>,
    <code>{{deny_reason}}</code>, <code>{{recipient_first_name}}</code> ("there" when an email
    rule sends to several people),
    <code>{{from_status}}</code>, <code>{{to_status}}</code>, <code>{{changed_by}}</code>,
    <code>{{approval_step}}</code> (Awaiting Approval only), <code>{{changes}}</code> (Field
    Edited only) and <code>{{field.column_name}}</code> for any field on the form. Clear a box to
    go back to the default.
    <% if field_names.any? %>
      <br>Field placeholders: <%= field_names.map { |n| "{{field.#{n}}}" }.join(", ") %>
    <% end %>
  </small>

  <% emails = form_template.emails.index_by(&:kind) %>
  <% Forms::TemplateEmail::KINDS.each do |kind| %>
    <% email = emails[kind] || Forms::TemplateEmail.new(form_template: form_template, kind: kind) %>
    <details class="notification-emails__item">
      <summary>
        <strong><%= email.label %></strong>
        <% if email.subject.present? || email.body.present? %>
          <span class="notification-emails__badge">Customized</span>
        <% end %>
      </summary>
      <p class="notification-emails__description"><%= email.description %></p>

      <label for="form_emails_<%= kind %>_subject" class="notification-emails__field-label">Subject</label>
      <input type="text" id="form_emails_<%= kind %>_subject"
             name="form_emails[<%= kind %>][subject]"
             class="form-control form-control-sm"
             value="<%= email.effective_subject %>">

      <label for="form_emails_<%= kind %>_body" class="notification-emails__field-label">Body</label>
      <textarea id="form_emails_<%= kind %>_body"
                name="form_emails[<%= kind %>][body]"
                class="form-control form-control-sm"
                rows="12"><%= email.effective_body %></textarea>
    </details>
  <% end %>
</div>
